# Edit (EDIT.PRG) session on the text shell (NODESK): sh tests/shots.sh EMU SD edit 30
# (0.31) The six pictures are taken at states, not at times: each "still 30" waits until the
# screen has not changed for 30 frames (the input before it handled, the drawing done), then
# "shot" (keyscript.py); the later times move by as long as the wait took. So the pictures
# do not depend on how fast the CPU or the kernel is (they were at 8.9 9.9 12.0 14.2 16.4
# 19.6 s; 12.0 caught REV $07's CPU redraw half done once the kernel's code moved).
#   1  fixed font: an edited line, a new line, a 3-line selection (Shift + arrows)
#   2  the selection copied (ctrl-C) and pasted at the end (ctrl-End, ctrl-V)
#   3  View > Proportional font
#   4  File > Save as...: the file dialog (the name field holds LONG.TXT, selected)
#   5  the dialog inside "docs" (double click), the name typed after Tab
#   6  saved as docs/edited.txt, one more key, File > Close: the Save / Discard / Cancel alert
# Then Esc (Cancel): Edit stays open. The pointer starts at (320, 180); moves of at most 100.
1500 {esc}
+1500 edit LONG.TXT\n
# Edit up and waiting (its window drawn)
5000 still 30
# line 5: append, a new line after it
6000 {down}{down}{down}{down}{end} -- edited\nA new line.
# select 3 lines from the start of line 3 (Shift held), copy
8000 {up}{up}{up}{home}{dE1}{down}{down}{down}{uE1}{dE0}c{uE0}
8700 still 30
+0 shot
# paste at the end of the text
9200 {dE0}{end}{uE0}{dE0}v{uE0}
9500 still 30
+0 shot
# View (105, 6) > Proportional font (second item, y 38)
10500 M -100:-100:0:0
+50 M -100:-74:0:0
+50 M -15:0:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
+300 M 0:32:0:0
+200 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
11700 still 30
+0 shot
# File (25, 6) > Save as... (fourth item, y 66)
12500 M -80:-32:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
+300 M 0:60:0:0
+200 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
13500 still 30
+0 shot
# the dialog's content is at (130, 53): double click "docs" (row 4, y 127)
14400 M 100:61:0:0
+50 M 65:0:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+80 M 0:0:0:0
+120 M 0:0:0:1
+80 M 0:0:0:0
# Tab to the name field, a new name
15300 {d2B}{u2B}edited.txt
16000 still 30
+0 shot
# Enter saves
16700 \n
# a change, then File > Close: the alert ((0.23) Close is 28 lines lower, below Print and
# a separator; the pointer goes back up after the click, where the picture had it)
17800 x
18300 M -100:-100:0:0
+50 M -65:-21:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
+300 M 0:88:0:0
+50 M 0:28:0:0
+150 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
+50 M 0:-28:0:0
19500 still 30
+0 shot
# Esc = Cancel
20500 {esc}
